# PRD-first

Before implementing or changing user-visible behavior:

1. Read [`prd/product-overview.md`](prd/product-overview.md)
2. Read the relevant file under [`prd/features/`](prd/features/)
3. Read matching screen docs under [`prd/screens/`](prd/screens/) when touching a route
4. Read [`prd/behavior/cross-cutting.md`](prd/behavior/cross-cutting.md) for locale, downloads interrupt, resume, orientation

When behavior changes intentionally, update the PRD(s) in the **same change set**. Do not silently diverge from documented acceptance criteria.

APIs: [`prd/apis-and-integrations.md`](prd/apis-and-integrations.md). ADRs: [`prd/decisions/`](prd/decisions/).
